      "created_at": "2018-08-15T12:19:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Y'all remember those jokes about sleeving the collector's case? Back when the question of whether or not sleeved cards would fit in the collector's case kept being asked over and over again in different ways?</p><p>Well, this is a touch embarassing, but I actually want to do that. I've got the collector's case set up so I can use it without having to move it, but I want to protect it from our cats, but that means I've got a sheet over it and can no longer see it's pretty, pretty logo.</p>",
